  "the whole file: one procedure, never stopping -- does it ever feel like a loop that nags?",
  "6.4, 14.4, 20.0, 22.8 s: the pulse leaves for each real post and line and the pedal holds: thin, not a hole?",
  "47.1-48.1 s: the dial-tone rest, then the Lighthouse on the ring",
  "52.2 s: the click cuts the Addendum; 55.3 s: the landing on \"How much?\" (sold)",
  "72.7-76.9 s: the clockwork winds down and hangs on one held C: an ending, not a stall?",
  "76.9 s: the REVERSAL on the card; 78.4 s the cut to one felt F4"
 ],
